From paul.metzner-Re5JQEeQqe8AvxtiuMwx3w at public.gmane.org  Fri Sep 13 11:12:46 2013
From: paul.metzner-Re5JQEeQqe8AvxtiuMwx3w at public.gmane.org (Paul Metzner)
